sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cron (hourly)
  participant M as Monday DM
  participant H as Hugs
  participant Q as Quests
  participant S as Slack adapter
  participant A as Analytics
  C->>M: scheduleMondayDms sweep
  M->>M: page waiting rows, dueAt = Monday 9:00 local
  M->>M: startMondayDm(row, attempt) fenced on tries
  M->>H: hugsSectionOf(member, week)
  M->>Q: questsSectionOf(member, week)
  alt both sections null (kind off, no hugs, not Monday path)
    M->>M: row skipped
  else at least one section
    M->>S: deliverMondayDm(sections, buttons)
    alt delivered
      S->>M: mondayDmEnded(sent)
      M->>A: dm sent{kind: monday, sections}
    else Slack error, tries < 3
      S->>M: mondayDmLater(attempt + 1)
    else gone or third failure
      S->>M: mondayDmEnded(failed)
    end
  end
